{
  "title": "Photo import drops the nutrition panel printed on the page",
  "description": "The photo extraction prompt (ramekin-core/src/ai/prompts/photo_extract.rs) and PhotoExtractResponse have no nutrition field, so a page's per-serving panel (\"Cal 780 • Total Fat 36g …\", as on the Tacos Chilorio and Potato Doughnuts photos in data/ai-evals/photos/) never reaches RawRecipe.nutritional_info. \
Text import's prompt does extract nutritional_info. \
Strong models copy the panel into notes instead, so it survives only as free text. \
Add nutritional_info to the photo prompt and response, add the expected panel to those golden cases (now in also_allowed), and score retention in the photo-extraction suite (make ai-eval SUITE=photo-extraction), as the suite already does for servings and times. \
Raised in review of PR #746.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "bug",
  "labels": [
    "ai",
  ],
